# G8 (graphics): the ruler's tab kind button. A click goes round left, centre, right and decimal; a click on the scale sets a tab of the
# kind the button shows; a stop is dragged along the ruler; the first-line marker at the left edge is still reached under the button.
# Every frame's CRC-32 must equal the host's.
@copy letter.rtf
@open LETTER.RTF
@click 4 86             # the button: centre
@click 100 88           # a centre tab
@click 4 86             # right
@click 200 88           # a right tab
@click 4 86             # decimal
@click 300 88           # a decimal tab
@drag 300 88 340 88     # moved along the ruler
@click 4 86             # left again
@click 400 88           # a left tab
@drag 0 79 48 79        # the first-line marker, under the button
f10 end enter
